add table ip ferm
delete table ip ferm
add table ip ferm
add chain ip ferm INPUT { type filter hook input priority 0; }
add rule ip ferm INPUT ct bytes >= 1048576 accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT ct original packets 100-200 accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT ct reply avgpkt < 500 drop
add rule ip ferm INPUT ct bytes 0-5000 accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT ct packets != 100-200 drop
add rule ip ferm INPUT ct bytes >= 4096 accept
add table ip6 ferm
delete table ip6 ferm
add table ip6 ferm
add chain ip6 ferm INPUT { type filter hook input priority 0; }
add rule ip6 ferm INPUT ct reply bytes >= 1024 accept
